{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie God is a Roguelite game with an RTS twist. Use unholy powers, destructive abilities, and experiment with zombie DNA to unleash abominations that will wipe out mankind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/fa9ec0e4860ba410cc5945acdf5c382b.poster.avif?t=1763570217\" width=974 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/fa9ec0e4860ba410cc5945acdf5c382b.webm?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/fa9ec0e4860ba410cc5945acdf5c382b.mp4?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/544e0d513f6abe6c9a6c9cb0edb7adac.poster.avif?t=1763570217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/544e0d513f6abe6c9a6c9cb0edb7adac.webm?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select a unique blessing to change the way you approach levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blessings get stronger the further into the game you go, just don't underestimate your early blessings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/1b2a288cf81a8a0225b40ba618d98b29.poster.avif?t=1763570217\" width=780 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/1b2a288cf81a8a0225b40ba618d98b29.webm?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/1b2a288cf81a8a0225b40ba618d98b29.mp4?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your route through the world map, deciding between high-risk rewards or safer paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infect and tear through hand-crafted maps, each offering multiple approaches to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye out for Hard maps, they aren't as forgiving as their counterparts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/65916b83dd61d979a22b5fbef17c53c6.poster.avif?t=1763570217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/65916b83dd61d979a22b5fbef17c53c6.webm?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage war against the living as they throw everything they have at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a powerful horde, strategically hunt for weaker humans before fighting the stronger enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the human populace and look out for Tanks, Mortar Teams, and other powerful city defences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/782f178dfbf812b5ccedfc1925acce8c.poster.avif?t=1763570217\" width=974 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/782f178dfbf812b5ccedfc1925acce8c.webm?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/782f178dfbf812b5ccedfc1925acce8c.mp4?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/5eeeeb8e3da0659f49c5d6a212f8dd1b.poster.avif?t=1763570217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/5eeeeb8e3da0659f49c5d6a212f8dd1b.webm?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Gather corpses from fallen humans or earn them through successful missions, then hunt for rarer research that you can use to evolve your zombies.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Continue to stockpile your resources, as you will need them to defeat humanity.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/d8b00c18e0627b625dab3b9fe6bdac31.gif?t=1763570217\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/d8b00c18e0627b625dab3b9fe6bdac31.poster.avif?t=1763570217\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the World Map, you can access the Shop as well as the DNA Upgrade area. The shop allows you to purchase new abilities, special zombies, and charges to help grow your destructive power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your research points on powerful DNA mutations for your zombies, giving them access to new effects and abilities to help you overpower your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/ea1c151440d64942afd50b088d2f35f3.gif?t=1763570217\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/ea1c151440d64942afd50b088d2f35f3.poster.avif?t=1763570217\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each completion of the world map, the humans' resistance level will increase. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This causes the maps to change, introducing more enemies and obstacles that you will need to be ready for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each resistance level, powerful unique modifiers will apply to the humans, making it more difficult as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you beat Resistance 5?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/36fa1c90802a653e3e8a20bf732e77f2.poster.avif?t=1763570217\" width=974 height=376 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/36fa1c90802a653e3e8a20bf732e77f2.webm?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/36fa1c90802a653e3e8a20bf732e77f2.mp4?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i></i><br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help build the future of Zombie God as we include community feedback in new updates. We  love to hear the thoughts and feedback of the community as it helps us build a better game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are still working on this game, and it is still in Early Access. As such, there may be bugs and other issues, if you find any, let us know, and we will fix them!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3035320?t=1763570217","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763570217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/f6da45a1d6c35c872719cf7eae53cddac6c71713/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763570217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/f6da45a1d6c35c872719cf7eae53cddac6c71713/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763570217","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Cartoon depictions of violence, blood & gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie God is a Roguelite game with an RTS twist. Use unholy powers, destructive abilities, and experiment with zombie DNA to unleash abominations that will wipe out mankind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/fa9ec0e4860ba410cc5945acdf5c382b.poster.avif?t=1763570217\" width=974 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/fa9ec0e4860ba410cc5945acdf5c382b.webm?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035320/extras/fa9ec0e4860ba410cc5945acdf5c382b.mp4?t=1763570217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted